     weston --backend=drm --renderer=gl
 
+Do NOT pass `--xwayland` yet. See below.
+
 Over ssh, weston needs a seat to open the DRM device; `LIBSEAT_BACKEND=seatd`
 with seatd running is the least painful way to get one.
 
